<div class="question_inner row"> <div class="col-lg-3"> <div class="question_menu"> <ul class="nav nav-tabs" id="myTab-c56454d" role="tablist"> <li class="nav-item" role="presentation"> <a href="#tab-c56454d-general" class="nav-link active" data-bs-toggle="tab" role="tab" aria-controls="tab-c56454d-general" aria-selected="true"> General </a> </li> <li class="nav-item" role="presentation"> <a href="#tab-c56454d-listings-properties" class="nav-link " data-bs-toggle="tab" role="tab" aria-controls="tab-c56454d-listings-properties" aria-selected="false"> Listings &amp; Properties </a> </li> <li class="nav-item" role="presentation"> <a href="#tab-c56454d-agents-users" class="nav-link " data-bs-toggle="tab" role="tab" aria-controls="tab-c56454d-agents-users" aria-selected="false"> Agents &amp; Users </a> </li> </ul> </div> </div> <div class="col-lg-9"> <div class="tab-content question_list mt-0" id="myTabContent-c56454d"> <div class="tab-pane fade show active" id="tab-c56454d-general" role="tabpanel"> <div class="ques_item fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.1s"> <a href="#faq-11765"> <h4>Does Propertylist.es require a credit card to join?</h4> </a> <p><strong>No</strong>, a form of payment is <strong>NOT required</strong> to join. Only if you want to <a href="https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/credits/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">buy credits.</a></p> </div> <div class="ques_item fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.2s"> <a href="#faq-11764"> <h4>Is PropertyList.es free to use?</h4> </a> <p>Yes, PropertyList.es is FREE to use with <a href="https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/credits/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">paid features</a> within the system that are optional.</p> </div> <div class="ques_item fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.3s"> <a href="#faq-11763"> <h4>What are the benefits of using PropertyList.es?</h4> </a> <p><strong>For Freelancers: </strong><br /> PropertyList.es allows freelancers to share their listings at no cost. This cost-efficient approach is especially helpful for those starting out in the industry.</p> <p><strong>For Agencies: </strong><br /> Agencies can freely share their properties with a wide audience. Additionally, they can manage staff accounts, listings, events, and documents—all in one place.</p> <p><strong>For Developers: </strong><br /> Listing new developments for free on PropertyList.es helps developers reach thousands of agents and buyers. It also facilitates connections with property services that may prove valuable.</p> <p><strong>For Property Services: </strong><br /> We welcome all services related to property, connect with estate agents, developers, and property seekers, expanding your network and business opportunities.</p> <p><strong>For Buyers/Renters:</strong><br /> 1. Extensive Property Listings: PropertyList.es aggregates a wide range of properties, making it easier for buyers and renters to find their ideal home or investment.<br /> 2. Agent Expertise: Buyers and renters can benefit from the expertise of real estate agents associated with the platform. Agents can guide them through the process, answer questions, and provide insights.<br /> 3. Advanced Search Filters: Users can filter properties based on specific criteria (such as location, price range, amenities, etc.), saving time and effort.</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> </div> <div class="ques_item fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.4s"> <a href="#faq-11762"> <h4>What is an MLS &amp; CRM?</h4> </a> <p data-sourcepos="8:3-8:53"><strong>Multiple Listing Service (MLS): </strong>This is a platform specifically designed for real estate agents to share information and collaborate on listings. PropertyList.es facilitates this agent-to-agent communication, allowing agents to expose their listings to a wider pool of potential buyers and renters represented by other agents on the platform totally FREE!</p> <p><strong>Customer Relationship Management (CRM):</strong> This is a software that helps agents manage their interactions with clients. PropertyList.es’ CRM features help agents track leads, manage communications, and stay organised throughout the sales or rental process.</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> </div> <div class="ques_item fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.5s"> <a href="#faq-11761"> <h4>What is PropertyList.es?</h4> </a> <p>PropertyList.es is a full-service solution for real estate agents in Spain. It functions as both a Multiple Listing Service (MLS), a Customer Relationship Management (CRM) and Lead Generation platform.</p> </div> </div> <div class="tab-pane fade " id="tab-c56454d-listings-properties" role="tabpanel"> <div class="ques_item fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.1s"> <a href="#faq-11768"> <h4>How can I access property market data on PropertyList.es?</h4> </a> <p><strong>In development – </strong>PropertyList.es provides access to valuable market data, including trends, comparative analysis tools, and insights into buyer preferences.</p> </div> <div class="ques_item fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.2s"> <a href="#faq-11767"> <h4>Can I link/add properties to a contact’s profile?</h4> </a> <p>Yes, <a href="https://propertylist.es/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PropertyList.es</a> allows you to link properties to contacts. <a href="https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/how-to-use-contacts/link-properties-to-contact/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Learn how to do this here.</a></p> </div> <div class="ques_item fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.3s"> <a href="#faq-11766"> <h4>How do I list a property on PropertyList.es?</h4> </a> <p>You’ll need to be a registered agent with a <a href="https://agents.propertylist.es/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PropertyList.es</a> account. <a href="https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/listing-a-property/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">The specific listing process can be found here.</a></p> </div> </div> <div class="tab-pane fade " id="tab-c56454d-agents-users" role="tabpanel"> <div class="ques_item fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.1s"> <a href="#faq-11771"> <h4>How can I assign a contact to a specific agent?</h4> </a> <p><a href="https://propertylist.es/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PropertyList.es</a> allows you to assign contacts to agents for streamlined communication and task management. <a href="https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/how-to-use-contacts/assign-contact-to-an-agent/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Learn how to assign your contact a staff member here</a>.</p> </div> <div class="ques_item fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.2s"> <a href="#faq-11770"> <h4>Can I add professional contacts to a client’s profile?</h4> </a> <p>Yes, <a href="https://propertylist.es/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PropertyList.es</a> allows you to link professional contacts (lawyers, architects, etc.) to your client’s profile. You can specify the type of professional relationship for better organization. <a href="https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/how-to-use-contacts/add-professional-contacts-to-a-contact/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Learn more here.</a></p> </div> <div class="ques_item fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.3s"> <a href="#faq-11769"> <h4>How do I sign up for PropertyList.es?</h4> </a> <p><a href="https://agents.propertylist.es/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Sign up for FREE here.</a> <em>(NO credit card information required, ever!)</em></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>
`,
