			desc: 'Export your listings as an XML feed URL for other platforms.',
			body: `
<h2>Export Listings XML</h2>
<p>PropertyList.es enables you to effortlessly export your property listings as an XML URL, a powerful tool for expanding your reach across multiple platforms including your own website.</p>
<p><a href="/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/listing-a-property/import-properties/">To import properties to your account click here</a></p>

<h3>Requirements</h3>
<ul>
	<li>A PropertyList account with administrative privileges.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Steps</h3>
<ol>
	<li><strong>Access the Export Section:</strong> Log in to your PropertyList.es account and navigate to the “Import &amp; Exports” tab on the left-hand side menu.</li>
	<li><strong>Choose the XML Format:</strong> Click “+NEW EXPORT FEED” and select a format from the dropdown list. To export all properties to your own website, select “PropertyList”.</li>
	<li>
		<strong>Filter Properties (Optional):</strong> Customise which properties are included using the filters below. If no filtering is selected, the export will include all of your listings.
		<ul>
			<li><strong>Private Notes:</strong> Add a note for this feed.</li>
			<li><strong>Property Order:</strong> Choose to order properties by newest or oldest first.</li>
			<li><strong>Max Listing Count:</strong> Set a maximum number of properties to export.</li>
			<li><strong>Include Sales:</strong> Checkbox to include properties for sale.</li>
			<li><strong>Set Prices (Sales):</strong> Select minimum and maximum sale prices.</li>
			<li><strong>Include Rentals:</strong> Checkbox to include properties for long-term rent.</li>
			<li><strong>Set Prices (Rentals):</strong> Select minimum and maximum monthly rental prices.</li>
			<li><strong>Location:</strong> Focus on specific areas by exporting listings within chosen locations.</li>
			<li><strong>Property Type:</strong> Select specific property types (e.g., apartments, villas, commercial spaces).</li>
			<li><strong>Bedrooms:</strong> Filter based on the number of bedrooms (e.g., studios, 1-bedroom, 2+ bedrooms).</li>
			<li><strong>Features:</strong> Filter based on available features like swimming pools, parking, or balconies.</li>
			<li><strong>Tags:</strong> Utilise any relevant tags you’ve assigned to your listings to further refine the export (e.g., “luxury”, “sea view”, “Idealista”).</li>
		</ul>
		<p><em>Each export has different criteria.</em></p>
