<h2>Bottom line</h2>
<p>${n} is worth shortlisting if you want clarity and comparability across micro-areas${typeof medPerM2 === 'number' ? `, with a current median around ~${fmtEur(medPerM2)}/m²` : ''}. Browse PropertyList to compare live options by pocket.</p>
</section>
